REASONS FOR ECONOMIC PROBLEM
The 3 main reasons for existence of economic problems are:
1. Unlimited Human Wants
Human wants are never ending, i.e. they can never
be fully satisfied. As soon as one want is satisfied,
another new want emerges. Human wants also
differ in priorities.
